      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82cf1f478714f5691f5262e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ライブでも、私が率先して盛り上げるよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddfd6c2e3f991b7f75048b4ec4752608f93ed009f437b4ef7d386bdba7c2029e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50a6d55f8fda391b44d45072",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウエストポーチにはガムを常備してあるんだ！\r\n噛めばいつでも元気チャージさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49a1fa7d5d3d2a01ab8becbfa261e676c4df2450579d2d5bd5dfa7d10cd93b4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2807e8bc2522d05de83b3fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんな服でも着こなしてみせる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a6e6ed83d9d057b386e4fca79174831ce4ab93cb2ec6076f75e55c9f074d06f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b283f3f932538db201e7e0ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新しい衣装って、テンション上がるね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84fdd31e87a03f88b63da9013659a2af97c6abbacf5b0aad1d4141a7ccd511e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2010998ad8f0cf1f72372ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れ様",
      "source_fingerprint": "b953841c6237f6f93550f5268f577fd573201293558ed014b9eb53c636e0c0c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fb89d8d41dc69dc3041ee10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おはよう、トレーナーさん！\r\nふふっ、自分から先に挨拶できると\r\n嬉しくなるよね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcf0025686100746ba1a50fa29c94d3a81f4eb94df47f406fe4ad5707dc0a241",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18893951bd97cecb3a75615a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早起きは得意なんだ。\r\n誰より先に起きられると嬉しいし、\r\n朝の時間を有効活用できる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f036a90556a34b257a955de84698ed725cc3c422524867c41c285b41125ad297",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6779c93f659f4afb25171a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カフェテリアに新メニューが出た\r\nから、1番乗りで食べてきたんだ！\r\nすごく個性的な味だったよ。ふふ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cc3e94be19f6c31c89dec9641e8fefe13d3398bcd1b2ffe762d32749e2aaa12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57c5fdcfb97b2ca49a91a9f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午後にうとうとしそうな時は、\r\nミント系のガムがオススメだよ。\r\nいる？ふふふ、いつもお疲れ様。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea63aa7e4d55e563fe206a439a82c2554799e3c0d140cc819210773cd877c21d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff82952ab29b2196bc032650",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寝る前は、しっかり歯磨き！虫歯は\r\n絶対、避けたいからね。治るまで\r\n甘いものを我慢なんて…嫌すぎる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84994d6b246410d31a069061091d397b4771214a900821ad996888dbad368118",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e69c04df0d3f74aeb7ffab1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさん、まだお仕事？\r\nんー…明日早起きしてやるってのは\r\nどうかな。頭が冴えて効率いいよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22c88d7cd22dd0b69d1ce5897f32040af8b552c015f73b3127762aa358b71480",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f7b9bcc6b03375ccebfc4cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カワイイ新入生たちがいっぱいだ。\r\nよし、声かけてこようか。\r\n早く仲良くなりたいからね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82d457dd9927d8aa4d33f868abfe721caf5165b09a7fe7b5de7bc8e609908f08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58a005a66072f9f344c5ee44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏と言ったら打ち上げ花火だよ！\r\n何もない真っ暗闇に、ぱっ！って\r\n弾けるのが気持ちいいんだよね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67eaff8a2fb7b8b193069fa356306373abda0bebdf31a16525230e1c5202c87b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cf9408a79dcebb5e863168e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースシーズン真っ盛りだね。\r\n臆せずに挑戦していきたいな。\r\nやってみなきゃわからないから…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc98df8d07cec03c1e05df3d55c1926389561c0ecc1c4f3c6ba7c6771f6d96a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:436342d550808a64ea39f486",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スズカは、雪が降ってても平気で\r\n早朝ランニングに行くんだ。\r\nわかるな、そうしたくなる気持ち。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dafce441bb11bcba63f07bce8abb70e7c0ed81fd3544f6feae31a4c17fd33c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daaf44d88b9925cfe171d233",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン",
      "source_fingerprint": "205aa64f55aa5b5868c584cadc0b5dcd8e05b84b0a76c8efb1da86986277c562",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9d918f2a2bbf292d4a30f29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "テスト前は、よくエアグルーヴと\r\n一緒に勉強するんだ。お互い得意な\r\nところを教え合うと捗るんだよね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f798ae42c1f30c2667099077ef38da300b54aed90c7dfc334fdc9e7ddfea4f7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a2c9009272189b8a1474083",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "マーベラスって“ゆめかわ”だ。\r\nあのふわふわキラキラした感じ…\r\nうーん、イイ。ぎゅってしたい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "669a08795de84b0c11c20c776c9b39ba57e70363ffd60487096ef484b846d2e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53f9437290a245249b7246cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ローレルがフランス土産の\r\n美味しいマカロンをくれたんだ。\r\nお茶会でも話が尽きなくて…ふふ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "67c5d8fd18542cfb4d9c4f8bf690405e92e2d32fd367e2cdf9aaf0abb6236fc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51f10726903bd9fb3f8413e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "マヤノって勘がいいから、1言えば\r\n10わかってくれるんだよね。\r\n話が早くて助かる子だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78f53412ddf3d4c71395ca292fbb24e8def3f6e2c8a4a6f1926cfaea9a91ee22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89659423de12e054c244641b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "母さんはよく、勤めてる会社の\r\n新作お菓子を送ってくれるんだ。\r\nしかも私の好きそうなのばっかり！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2903fbda64cd43c6e019c6fefe05865017c377047f73a4885c6f5e7c96c423b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa3d995bb38b82312919f856",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ライブのダンスってはじけるよね！\r\n社交ダンスと全然違うんだ。\r\n新しいことをやるのは、燃える！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7a087d46dba011a70c38036963bf6bb74a476b3979b4bf5e3f28f4cfaed3760",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab2bb964c196e47d2d5de584",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "歌い出し？任せてよ！\r\n緊張して声が出ない…\r\nなんてこと私にはないから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48b4f1e6be826acc69839ac6bed2f5560e2971b7b4986d170179716d09669ff8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84f6b32412f35087c1768568",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウエストが出る服って、鍛えるぞ！\r\nって気になれていいよね。\r\n今日も腹筋しておこうっと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "616bdc1bb5958520071870476b429121d18c214f29e72af731a23ccacd142bbf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:488f937a474c82d56049ce0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黄色って好きなんだ。\r\n明るくて元気が出るでしょ？\r\nブルーと合わせると華やかだよね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76a077ec248c62bba134b0cd3edc5aee70919fe0bce02443629644089cd9321e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ee94ce7cb59137a95c1e049",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "んー…！早朝ランニング、気持ち\r\nよかった！朝から体を動かすと\r\n1日すっきり過ごせるよね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a83e77f22f518aef8809acc8ada52d04f2dc2cec77adb245a0b75b41890b193",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:346651f42afa0a699ca382e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午前中にやった小テスト…結果が\r\n楽しみだ！勉強の成果を試すのって\r\nレースと似たわくわくがあるよね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ce9d0a53e8f7566c550193d12fe482ffacb4282ba2205c8fbfdbc38c78979d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b62d499d834bb5e0f0af950b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日も充実した1日だった！\r\nうん、明日はもっと上を目指すよ。\r\nそういう毎日が夢を膨らますんだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1842598e7d646240903ab20032b260e8841f33b83650659c9d6cf54db73892c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2536a6c30a9a278c2168aeb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春って新しいことばかりで戸惑う\r\nかもだけど…私は、迷うよりまず\r\nやってみるのが大事だと思うんだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57f5022575e222a81d5f09c670b9b24567bd0cf02ad26f5fbe21a8bf2e892811",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b447ac3b7a93cb996ff8ff5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "入学前の夏休みは、毎年家族で\r\n高原の別荘に避暑に行ってたな。\r\nテニスやったり湖で泳いだり！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5293d531fdf1dcce40671d7474ad9a5e5c2f8292fb3f3f74a1741ced00a3ea00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c6bf7662fa5f7d9fa8d38d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "モンブラン、ブドウのパルフェ、\r\nスイートポテト…秋のパティスリー\r\nって新作だらけで目移りする…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d237140f200d2c28412feca6c747dcd54234a21806f75d1bc25d701174b2c9ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5708ecaa82ad83e69eb3a3d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒くても換気は小まめに。\r\n埃っぽい部屋は鼻づまりになるから\r\n苦手なんだよね…健康第一だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "019a197d8b93f44e8d41dc893de8f4047cd285fa7a3f873adfd5dc786ebb6260",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4abfb44b75c89c93d163ba4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この服、爆発をイメージした\r\nプリントがついてるでしょ？\r\n視界に入るたび気合いが入るんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d58e54f56f699e9d24eb3a120ece40358164d1138e44708583329baa0be35828",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebf956151633015e0803cca6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やってみせる",
      "source_fingerprint": "57e835c304d749feac53c2c93c044f238781d83979d2b5689e217a20ed7ef6ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f52c820933c9567fdee964c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ベルトはズレないように\r\nキツめに締めてるんだ。その方が\r\n背筋もしゃきっとするしね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a7fb4165a8e515fcaa25fe5e156fe8d3691fe518c42e2a447c60f5d82387ebe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3667ddd06fdfc079d6485e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんなトレーニングもこなすから、\r\n厳しく頼むよ、トレーナーさん。\r\n『私は、次のレースで絶対勝つ！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e3cada28a3792296849374878d5fee4edb21739e90752fcdf1afce79295670b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:126fd213879a7de0447acf74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "幼馴染のみんなに負けない…いや、\r\n引っ張っていける自分になるんだ！\r\n私たちが最強だって示すために！",
      "source_fingerprint": "962f17172f58dd284cc057b1c700276a6154db15dd9649e82cda1b4ae15a5bf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:003758699cce088e88bd5985",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、今日もはじけていこう！\r\nこの脚の爆発力を、\r\nもっともっと鍛えるんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d5339f3a4d66db3195ddfbe48e7c0bf12c1c31a30ac36d8348c5add3dc10a79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8416e9ac23e23f207a0140e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宣言する。\r\n『私はトレーナーさんと共に\r\nレース界に爆風を巻き起こす！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a6326ba4f433805546b9c226ed2f1da4625947f0386722751f75d8f9f3b9648",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdd0dbddfe3d0bbb33daafb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いい指導者に巡り合えたなって\r\n思うんだ。誰より私を理解してる。\r\n貴方がいれば、絶対に強くなれる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6280b7b3f157e0e1858b056ce460263ae9c3ebdf3a72b43b621488f5ebfb8354",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e34afffeb3ed69b598920fbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングも遊びも全力で！\r\nせっかくの海だ、\r\n思いきり楽しもうっ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6db6658ef4c6b567a5af9eee9b5fa67e8a6b200756e2fb69affee0f37bc12f65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b07261514dd9d87ca1c80954",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方となら、夢はどこまでも膨らむ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "72d37047a87c37267e52295d31bdc0d05565f20998286105759cd73c6cf540a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dff4f87036258da1abf0455",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挑戦できて、よかった！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a98947ebaed459a8b506be77f92821a96b4686e4da2e033261fd765e26da7dcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f07368a5bdfe0577d9582aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私、やっぱり才能あるかな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f0e02f72a002dfa75475a757d63682b9da2ef0d26ce372d737f0372bd8ab679",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86041b2faf94b6822593ac11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "限界の先へ…切り込む！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc3284a7367eb79bd8ca49959d09b36e19e54123c9be22b63f4ae3faaa5311fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eed2675c95d4dbc8ecd9eafc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バブルガムフェローだよ、よろしく。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ba9b0f68a14ff9ee25ae94109ec0b9c5a6a84eae0768eb5f01cfe1889b6095b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbd5a50e09a06e66203aec2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いいよ、宣言する！\r\n『絶対に私が勝つ！！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a42ad88387c470ac0dd747dc8bd29e97f6c197f89ae7849e064550f47d6d97b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e8067d0ec8b0de240f63664",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "同气相求……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3619ebeaee7233f36e5337abfbf433c87bab1224336e3bb5c33e7903c3aac42a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1126",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6cd4c1a06549123ed416f17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "千年的漫漫长路，愿与你同行……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0a269529d46dc52111d44fd4c3c9186ea29eaed54c71633bd8aac2a6b25bf78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1126",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bedece39ae4da1f7e2191e8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "犹如云外苍天般的心境……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6ccabb94a72dcfcd6b2aeab46b58613f083248bbdd171110519bf2bcaef1105",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1126",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9caf7b8e9b93f7e42f6f18b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，要出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "849c0c3b42eb2774cbe0975112a27fbd3b244514467ef4ff9ae527ddc51556b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d533baf38852c1af7010c36f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起出国远征的时候，\n你急忙学了当地的语言吧。\n事出突然，但还是谢谢你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "926cb849aa065c14db9bd3b178ab5edbffef63a2cebdc9f302c9e1cb98ea220f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:413682238d200f70fb922624",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd24a1b93aeb74bc0443da46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0911e22207ebd4e5b2465a4d2378a3328e0057ddd0a0764d77344297201735f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bdadc1934d653abe5ead50e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跑了多远，你也一起\n前进了多远…呵呵，我们的话\n到底能走到多远的地方呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5f6a29f181eb1cc003a93f119d2075cbe703fd7c934173e26702a79fec7af59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03c7ef9dfc15217e13a1b37a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拍Q丸的广告，\n真的好新鲜啊。追求\n0.1秒的世界…就像比赛一样呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0480fa4dbb34bc1089decd948784405cdb517ce57a3d3ae2d191d660a35d086",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35fa59e92ed3d48921a302dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然要回老家一趟，但我打算\n早点回来。可不能把时间\n全花在休息上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f5a5002694c8057c39b9ff5e9c95a484f2ff202f58f5f46f5c502faf1ece4d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:628cb012fcdaa8b29667b1f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "粉丝来信好像比平时\n更多了。大家温暖的心意…\n深深地渗透进心里了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7df3a09babb627aa45abc1bcd81ac733a918684b2258dbf1ebd2e941c9465e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10004"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
